            "int main() {",
            "    show(3);",
            "    return 0;",
            "}"
          ],
          "options": [
            "3\n2\n1",
            "1\n2\n3",
            "3",
            "nothing"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "show prints n, then calls itself with n - 1, until n is 0."
        },
        {
          "id": "c9-l1-e5",
